        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Sid Meier's Civilization is a turn-based strategy computer game created by Sid Meier for MicroProse in 1991.The game's objective is \"...to build an empire that would stand the test of time\". The game begins in 4000 BC, and the players attempt to expand and develop their empires through the ages until modern and near-future times. It is also known simply as Civilization.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Sid Meier's Civilization es un videojuego de estrategia por turnos creado por Sid Meier para MicroProse en 1991. El objetivo del juego es «...construir un imperio que resista la prueba del tiempo». La partida comienza en el 4000 a. C., y los jugadores intentan expandir y desarrollar sus imperios a lo largo de las eras hasta los tiempos modernos y el futuro cercano. También se conoce simplemente como Civilization.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1991",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
